  "scope_statement_zh": "本清单对提交包内每一交付物按文件级登记 sha256 / 资产类别 / 权利基础 / 处置决定 / 可否再分发 / 是否含第三方内容。处置分布见 disposition_distribution。COMMUNITY-DISPLAY-ONLY 明确限本次社区评审展示、仓库归档与翻译，不用于商业化或法定背书；嵌入 4 份 A0/A3 PDF 的 Noto Sans SC 字体子集按 SIL OFL 1.1 可重分发（OFL 署名义务适用于该嵌入子集；见各 PDF 条目 rights_basis），不作为独立文件分发；ODbL 衍生品须保留 OpenStreetMap 贡献者署名；第三方代码库以链接形式引用、不内嵌分发；公共知识（九章算术、京张文脉）保留为概念引用。",
  "scope_statement_en": "This registry records per-path sha256, asset category, rights basis, disposition, redistribution permission, and third-party content flag for every deliverable. COMMUNITY-DISPLAY-ONLY is explicitly limited to community review display, archive, and translation — NOT for commercial use or statutory endorsement. The Noto Sans SC font subset embedded in the 4 A0/A3 PDFs is redistributable under SIL OFL 1.1 (OFL attribution applies to the embedded subset; see each PDF entry's rights_basis) and is not distributed as a standalone file. ODbL derivatives must retain OpenStreetMap attribution. Third-party code libraries are referenced via URL only and not embedded for redistribution. Public-domain concept references (《九章算术》, 京张 heritage) are retained as conceptual citations.",
  "self_declaration_zh": "作者 li-zhaojun 在提交时确认：除明确标注 COMMUNITY-DISPLAY-ONLY 的资源仅限本次社区展示外，其余自创内容（proposal.md 文本、几何、设计证据、HTML 报告与可视化）在保留署名前提下允许本次征集组织者用于评审展示、归档、翻译与公开复用。",
  "self_declaration_en": "Author li-zhaojun confirms at submission: aside from assets explicitly labeled COMMUNITY-DISPLAY-ONLY (which are limited to community display), all other self-authored content (proposal text, geometry, design evidence, HTML reports and visualizations) may be used by the contest organizers for review display, archive, translation, and public reuse with attribution preserved.",
